Notes:
  - i18n catalog generator: res/values*/strings.xml is AUTO-GENERATED by
    apps/shared/i18n/generators/gen-i18n.ts from web/src/i18n/en.json. The
    committed catalog is ALREADY drifted from en.json before this change
    (pre-existing, unrelated to this artifact). To avoid sweeping that unrelated
    drift into this page artifact, the two new keys were added at the en.json
    source AND hand-inserted into the three Android strings.xml files
    byte-identically to what emitAndroidStrings()/androidName()/renderValue()
    produce: androidName('translation.settings.account.twoFactor.title') =
    'translation_settings_account_twoFactor_title' (dots->underscores), value
    has no &/</> so renderValue is a passthrough; sorted between
    'translation.sessions' and 'translation.settings.advanced.*' (account<advanced,
    sessions<settings). A future full gen-i18n.ts run re-emits these exact lines
    (no conflict). Honest disclosure (no silent drift, covenant #9).
  - SI: no field on this surface is unit-bearing — no SI conversion needed.
  - States: TOTPEnrollmentSection renders loading / empty(open-mode) /
    not-enrolled / active / stale-offline / error+retry for its bound status
    feed (verified by the shared TOTPEnrollmentSectionViewModelTest +
    TOTPEnrollmentSectionUiTest + TOTPEnrollmentSectionProjectionTest, run by
    testDebugUnitTest below).
  - i18n: every visible literal via stringResource (ADR-014); web key names kept.
  - a11y: PageTitle heading + copy-link IconButton contentDescription; the
    feature view supplies pill/field/modal/QR content descriptions + dynamic/dark
    theme (ADR-015).
  - Layout: the feature view lays out as a non-lazy Column, so it composes safely
    inside the page's outer verticalScroll container.

